<title>SWEDEN: Foreningsbanken says to delist June 12.</title>
<headline>Foreningsbanken says to delist June 12.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank Foreningsbanken said on Thursday it would delist its shares from the Stockholm Stock Exchange on June 12 following its merger with Swedbank.</p>
<p>Swedbank now controls more than 95 percent of capital and votes in Foreningsbanken, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
